      "label": "Male Lion Domination",
      "description": "The visual metaphor of the male lion mounting the female lion is used to represent male dominance and female submission. This is a common trope in animal imagery used to symbolize power dynamics, often in a derogatory way toward women, implying they are passive and accepting of male control.",
