      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Mysogynous",
      "description": "The meme uses the visual metaphor of a female lion being mounted by a male lion to represent a woman who has been tricked into paying for something she thought was free. This reinforces harmful stereotypes about women's emotional instability, susceptibility to manipulation, and lack of agency, fitting within the 'Mysogynous' category as it contains hate against women by implying their perceived weakness and lack of agency.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
